    "body": "Maintainer decision, 2026-11-22: hold for a dry run first.\n\nThe change is small and the source review found no blocker. The step has never run, and a failure in the `publish` job would stop a release. Please show the step working before the merge:\n- Download the assets of the release `v0.25.0` into an empty directory named `dist/`.\n- Run the new step script there, on your own machine.\n- Post the resulting `SHA256SUMS.txt` and the `sha256sum -c` output in a comment.\n- State which asset patterns matched and which release assets did not match any pattern, if there are any.\n\nDo not add a workflow trigger for this check. When the output is posted, the coordinator re-reads the PR and merges it pinned to the head.\n\nThe label `needs-maintainer` is removed, because the decision is made and the next step is yours.\n",
